<p>Returns the current system time in milliseconds</p>

<b>Get parameters</b>
<ul><li> action = "getTime"</li>
</ul>
<b>Get examples:</b>
<xmp class="panel" of-exclude="true">
// Simple URL
/OpenForum/Actions/SystemTime?action=getTime

// Using JSON.get
JSON.get('/OpenForum/Actions/SystemTime', 'getTime', <i></i>
  .onSuccess(function(result) {
    console.log('System time:', result.time);
  }).go();
</xmp>


